---
backend: {{ backend }}
{%- if backend == 'hcp' %}
hcp_org: {{ hcp_org | tojson }}
{%- endif %}
github_org: {{ github_org | tojson }}
apex_domain: {{ apex_domain | tojson }}
cloudflare_account_id: {{ cloudflare_account_id | tojson }}
cloudflare_zone_id: {{ cloudflare_zone_id | tojson }}
managed_repos:
{%- for repo in managed_repos %}
  - {{ repo | tojson }}
{%- endfor %}
{%- if backend == 'hcp' %}
hcp_status_check_id: {{ hcp_status_check_id | tojson }}
{%- else %}
state_backend: {{ state_backend }}
state_bucket: {{ state_bucket | tojson }}
state_prefix: {{ state_prefix | tojson }}
{%- if state_backend == 's3' %}
state_lock_table: {{ state_lock_table | tojson }}
{%- endif %}
{%- if state_backend in ['s3', 'azurerm'] %}
state_region: {{ state_region | tojson }}
{%- endif %}
{%- if state_backend == 'azurerm' %}
azure_storage_account: {{ azure_storage_account | tojson }}
azure_resource_group: {{ azure_resource_group | tojson }}
{%- endif %}
{%- endif %}
---

# infra-copilot configuration

Rendered by copier from the answers in `.copier-answers.yml`. These are public
deployment identifiers. Never put credentials or secrets here. Change a value by
running `copier update` and reviewing the diff, not by hand-editing, so the Terraform
backend blocks stay aligned.
